            p("Think of a cloakroom. You hand over a long, bulky coat and get a small numbered ticket. Anyone with the ticket gets the coat back. The cloakroom never hands out the same number twice, because it counts up; and so that nobody can guess other people's tickets, the numbers on the tickets are shuffled."),
